---
import HubPage from '@/layouts/HubPage.astro';
import { IconArrowLeft, IconArrowRight, IconBrandYoutube, IconListNumbers, IconNotes, IconFileText, IconBooks, IconInfoCircle } from '@tabler/icons-react';
// Keep the example available in development only until real episodes are ready.
export function getStaticPaths() {
  return import.meta.env.DEV ? [{ params: { path: undefined } }] : [];
}
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const focusLink = 'inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium underline-offset-4 hover:underline';
const sectionLink = 'inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-3 text-sm underline decoration-border underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-current [&_svg]:size-4 [&_svg]:shrink-0';
const headingLink = 'inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-sm hover:underline underline-offset-4';
---

<HubPage title="Podcast preview | Islam with Ayoub" path="podcast-preview/" noindex>
  <main class="min-h-dvh bg-background px-5 py-8 font-sans text-foreground sm:py-12">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <a href={base} class={focusLink}><IconArrowLeft size={18} /> Back to links</a>
      <div class="mt-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-secondary px-4 py-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Design preview. The episode title, outline, and transcript below are examples. The video is an existing upload, not a released podcast episode.
      </div>

      <section aria-labelledby="homepage-example" class="mt-10">
        <h2 id="homepage-example" class="text-sm font-semibold">On your homepage</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">A compact section below your main reading links would introduce the latest episode.</p>
        <a href="#episode" class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-5 rounded-3xl bg-secondary p-5 transition-colors hover:bg-accent">
          <IconBrandYoutube size={36} strokeWidth={1.5} className="shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" />
          <span class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">The podcast with Ayoub</span>
            <span class="mt-1 block text-lg font-semibold">Making time to understand Islam</span>
            <span class="mt-2 block text-sm text-muted-foreground">Watch the episode, read the notes, or follow the transcript.</span>
          </span>
          <IconArrowRight size={20} className="shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" />
        </a>
      </section>

      <article id="episode" class="mt-14 scroll-mt-6 border-t border-border pt-10">
        <header>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Example episode page</p>
          <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Making time to understand Islam</h1>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">A conversation about reading the Quran, asking questions, and putting what we learn into practice.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground">With Ayoub · Sample episode</p>
        </header>

        <figure class="mt-7">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/HVmHxSztp_A"
            title="Example player: How Ayoub Uses AI During TikTok Live"
            width="1280"
            height="720"
            loading="lazy"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            class="aspect-video h-auto w-full rounded-2xl border-0 bg-secondary"
          ></iframe>
          <figcaption class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Player demonstration using your existing video, “How Ayoub Uses AI During TikTok Live.” The sample notes below do not describe this video.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <a href="https://youtu.be/HVmHxSztp_A" class={`${focusLink} mt-2`}><IconBrandYoutube size={20} /> Open the demo video on YouTube</a>

        <nav aria-labelledby="contents-title" class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-secondary/50 p-5">
          <h2 id="contents-title" class="mb-2 text-base font-semibold">On this page</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="#outline" class={sectionLink}><IconListNumbers aria-hidden="true" />Episode outline</a></li>
            <li><a href="#notes" class={sectionLink}><IconNotes aria-hidden="true" />My notes</a></li>
            <li><a href="#transcript" class={sectionLink}><IconFileText aria-hidden="true" />Transcript</a></li>
            <li><a href="#resources" class={sectionLink}><IconBooks aria-hidden="true" />Reading alongside the episode</a></li>
            <li><a href="#ai-disclaimer" class={sectionLink}><IconInfoCircle aria-hidden="true" />AI disclaimer</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>

        <section id="outline" class="scroll-mt-6 pt-9">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold"><a href="#outline" class={headingLink}>Episode outline <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-muted-foreground">#</span></a></h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Sample topics for a future conversation.</p>
          <ol class="mt-5 list-decimal space-y-3 pl-5 text-base leading-relaxed marker:text-muted-foreground">
            <li>Why I want to start this podcast</li>
            <li>Making room for Quran reading in everyday life</li>
            <li>Questions that come up during the live</li>
            <li>Learning about hadith with context</li>
            <li>One thing to reflect on after listening</li>
          </ol>
        </section>

        <section id="notes" class="scroll-mt-6 pt-10">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold"><a href="#notes" class={headingLink}>My notes <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-muted-foreground">#</span></a></h2>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-base leading-8">
            <p>Example host note: I want this podcast to give us more time for the questions that come up during the live. Some topics need a longer conversation and a place to collect the reading afterwards.</p>
            <p>For this first conversation, I'd like to ask: what makes it easier for us to keep learning, even when life is busy?</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="transcript" class="scroll-mt-6 pt-10">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold"><a href="#transcript" class={headingLink}>Transcript <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-muted-foreground">#</span></a></h2>
          <a href="#ai-disclaimer" class={focusLink}>How AI was used in this content</a>
          <details class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-border px-5">
            <summary class="flex min-h-14 cursor-pointer items-center py-3 text-sm font-semibold">Read a sample transcript excerpt</summary>
            <div class="space-y-4 border-t border-border py-5 text-base leading-8">
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Illustrative text only. This is not a transcript of the video above.</p>
              <p><strong>Ayoub:</strong> Assalamu alaikum, and welcome. I wanted to make a space where we can take our time with the questions we discuss during the live.</p>
              <p><strong>Ayoub:</strong> Today, let's start with something simple. How do we make time to read, ask questions, and think about what we're learning?</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </section>

        <section id="resources" class="scroll-mt-6 pt-10">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold"><a href="#resources" class={headingLink}>Reading alongside the episode <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-muted-foreground">#</span></a></h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Example resources. Each published episode can include its own references here.</p>
          <div class="mt-3 flex flex-col items-start">
            <a href="https://quran.com/" class={focusLink}>Read the Quran on Quran.com <IconArrowRight size={16} /></a>
            <a href="https://go.alphabravomedia.co/riyad-as-salign-pdf" class={focusLink}>Riyad as-Salihin PDF <IconArrowRight size={16} /></a>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section id="ai-disclaimer" aria-labelledby="ai-disclaimer-title" class="mt-10 scroll-mt-6 border-t border-border pt-6">
          <h2 id="ai-disclaimer-title" class="text-xl font-semibold"><a href="#ai-disclaimer" class={headingLink}>AI disclaimer <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-muted-foreground">#</span></a></h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            I want you to know where AI has helped create or edit the content that accompanies each episode. I'll document what was changed, which tools I used, and what I personally reviewed. The views I express in the podcast are my own.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium">Example disclosure format, to be completed for each episode.</p>
          <dl class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            <div>
              <dt class="font-semibold">Transcript</dt>
              <dd class="mt-1 text-muted-foreground">Record whether Whisper was used for transcription, which tool cleaned up grammar or punctuation, and whether the text was checked against the recording. Note any edits beyond those corrections.</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="font-semibold">Thumbnail</dt>
              <dd class="mt-1 text-muted-foreground">State whether AI generated or edited any part of the thumbnail, name the tool, and describe the changes.</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="font-semibold">Description, outline, and notes</dt>
              <dd class="mt-1 text-muted-foreground">List any AI drafting, summarizing, or rewriting, alongside the tool used and what I reviewed myself.</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="font-semibold">Other episode content</dt>
              <dd class="mt-1 text-muted-foreground">Document any other AI use, including research assistance, generated images, audio, or video. If no AI was used for an item, say so explicitly.</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">These are template prompts, not disclosures about the demonstration video above.</p>
        </section>
        <footer class="mt-10 border-t border-border pt-5">
          <a href={base} class={focusLink}><IconArrowLeft size={18} /> Back to Ayoub's links</a>
        </footer>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</HubPage>
